notes.content:
2025.7.16 Update Description
1. Solved the speed control bug, resolved the issue of the card library page and card type page not popping up, and restored the in-game settings;
2. Adjusted the fonts of various cards and solved the problem of some fonts appearing empty;
3. Supported MAC and fixed some bugs;
4. Other optimizations.

Demo 0.3.5 Update Description:
1. The judgment when selecting the "A, B, C, D" brand type for repairing "Feng Shui chaos";
2. When 'Dui for Ze' and 'Qian for Tian' are added, all cards can trigger 'Qian for Tian';
3. Fixed the function of resetting the sky canopy during the 'Wuqu · Ming' period;
4. Help refresh the page;
5. Other optimizations.

Demo 0.3.3 Update Description:
1. Fixed the issue of ignoring the upper limit of hexagram cards when obtaining hexagrams in the hexagram card pack;
2. After the repair failed, clicking 'New Start' continued the previous game;
3. Fixed the issue of using zodiac signs with 'Di Shan Qian' but it still works.

Demo 0.3.2 version update:
1. Fix the issue with the talent card 'Empty Door'.
2. Fix the settlement issue of the hexagram card 'Shuizhe Festival';
3. Even if the card pack is fast, you can't claim too much;
4. [Hexagram sign] Restoration of Feng Shui laxity;
5. Fix the card type 'Qi Sheng' calculation logic;

1. Fix the issue of card freezing when skipping in the store after using the card
2. Fix the issue of resetting to 0 when reopening
3. Fix the problem where the star sign disappears when it cannot be used
4. Update the description of Heart Moon Fox;
5. Repair the barrier to water;
6. Fix the issue of Jiaomu Jiao taking effect in the Star constellation card package;
7. Various description updates.

Mac version launched
1. After patient persuasion from the Heavenly Court, several fairies playing fairy music finally left the Zixiao Palace Chess Pavilion and lowered the background music;
2. The hexagram of Ze Shan Xian is derived from the hexagram of Shan Ze Qi, which promotes the connection between heaven and man. As a result, your experience points in the game have greatly increased, and you can obtain the "divination value" by upgrading your level. The divination value can be used to construct your hexagram combination in the collection;
3. Some other bugs.
Preview:
The beginner guide is expected to be available tomorrow.

1. The music volume decreases;
2. Significantly increased the experience gained from the game;
3. Other bugs.

1. Fixed the display issue of the maximum consumption card limit;
2. Fixed the issue of lagging after refreshing the store many times;
3. Optimized the experience of upgrading and downgrading during divination. Upgrades and downgrades will only be locked when you confirm;
4. Other bugs.
